# Scanner output. --out takes any directory, so these are ignored by artifact name
# wherever they land. SOURCE_INDEX.jsonl carries raw source content and is private by
# design: it must never be committed, here or into a scanned repository.
STATIC_ANALYSIS.json
SOURCE_INDEX.jsonl
run/
runs/

# Per-run analysis workspaces: transcripts, access logs, and provider results. These
